/-!
# The thin diagram `PC7`

Open penny-farthing (`n = 2`): the `Ã₄` cycle `x → x ← t → c → c ← x` along `α²`, `β α`, `γ`, a radical endomorphism `ℓ` of `c`, and `a₁ γ`.

Generated by `scripts/gen_thin_shape.py`.
-/

@[expose] public section

